{
  "id": "poem-7778e85cb587212d909b7a7b",
  "title": "越江吟·神仙神仙瑶池宴",
  "author": "苏易简",
  "dynasty": "宋",
  "verses": [
    "神仙神仙瑶池宴。",
    "片片。",
    "碧桃零落春风晚。",
    "翠云开处，隐隐金舆挽。",
    "玉麟背冷清风远。"
  ],
  "enabled": true,
  "collection": "宋词选",
  "source": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry/blob/b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee/宋词/ci.song.0.json#record-4",
